<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Auto Backup on Android 11 and older (android:fullBackupContent). Android 12+ reads
  data_extraction_rules.xml instead; the two lists must say the same thing.

  BACKED UP, ON PURPOSE: the offline outbox (files/outbox: queue.json and the photo and audio copies
  its entries point to), the questionnaire session queue and consent queue, unsaved form drafts
  (files/drafts) with their media (files/drafts-media, files/field-captures), and the small device
  settings. They are the researcher's work and must survive a lost or replaced phone. A restored
  queued create still carries its Idempotency-Key, so one the old phone sent within the last 30
  days is answered from the server's record instead of being filed twice. The outbox's media stays
  with its queue: a restored entry whose file is missing would upload without it.

  INTERVIEW AUDIO IS NOT IN THE CLOUD BACKUP (files/questionnaire-recordings). Cloud Auto Backup
  allows 25 MB per app and skips the WHOLE backup above it, so one long interview would cost
  everything above its backup. A restored session whose clip is missing marks that step failed and
  says the recording is missing on this device (SessionOutbox), so nothing is lost silently.
  Android 12+ still moves the audio in a device-to-device transfer, which has no such cap
  (data_extraction_rules.xml).

  NEVER BACKED UP: the sign-in session (field_repository_auth.xml holds the bearer token and the
  cached profile), so a restored phone signs in again and two-step verification is asked again;
  the staged-object journal, whose entries belong to a process on the old phone; the read cache
  and WorkManager's own bookkeeping. Two-step state and secrets are never stored on the device.
-->
<full-backup-content>
    <exclude domain="sharedpref" path="field_repository_auth.xml" />
    <exclude domain="file" path="staged-objects.json" />
    <exclude domain="database" path="androidx.work.workdb" />
    <exclude domain="database" path="androidx.work.workdb-shm" />
    <exclude domain="database" path="androidx.work.workdb-wal" />
    <exclude domain="file" path="questionnaire-recordings/" />
</full-backup-content>
